  chef: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3edf825c44ba8994197fd4cca4373a22, type: 2}
  letterBody: 'Hello,


    A traveler who ate at your shop left a long review online.
    He said the food tasted like someone cared. That is rare. I wanted to write to
    the person who cooks like that.


    I am Lin Wei. Before I owned a restaurant,
    I washed dishes in one for six years. The chef paid us in egg fried rice made
    from yesterday''s rice. It was the best meal of my day.


    Cold rice, a very
    hot wok, egg first, then rice, and keep everything moving.


    Nothing in a
    kitchen should be wasted. Not rice, not people.'
